AREAS NEEDING THE MOST CARE (these determine byte-identical encoder output):
1. `FSE_writeNCount_generic` — the bitStream accumulation, `previousIs0` run-length encoding of zero counts, the 0xFFFF/24-bit flush logic, and the exact end-of-buffer checks. Any deviation changes the emitted header bytes.
